@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+---
+id: dl-001-use-sequential-task-identifiers
+type: decision-log
+title: "Use sequential task identifiers"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+Tasks need stable references after a rename. The domain cannot use clocks or random values to
+generate identifiers.
+
+## Decision
+
+Each in-memory task list assigns the next sequential identifier, `task-1`, `task-2`, and so on,
+when a task is added. Operations resolve an identifier before a title.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Identifiers are deterministic and unique within a list, remain unchanged when a title changes, and
+can be used by all existing title-taking operations. They are not globally unique across separately
+created task lists.
