+type: task
+title: "Add stable task identifiers"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implemented deterministic, list-unique task identifiers. Added `get(id)` and made every existing
+title-taking operation resolve a task identifier, including after a rename. Updated the public API
+documentation and added tests for identifier lookup and mutation.
